flowchart TD
    Field["Response field"]
    Classified{"Classified?"}
    Action["Pseudonymise, redact or remove per classification"]
    Unclassified["Unclassified: source withheld, FAIL_REQUEST; call refused if every answered source is withheld"]
    Scan{"Source tree contains a detected identifier shape?"}
    RefusedShape["Source withheld; call refused if every answered source is withheld"]
    Returned["Field returned"]

    Field --> Classified
    Classified -->|yes| Action
    Action --> Scan
    Classified -->|no| Unclassified
    Scan -->|yes| RefusedShape
    Scan -->|no| Returned
